<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger"><cb n="124"/>
24 Gras in de Wên, Butter in de Kelder.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Franz. Flandern.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, III, 697, 5.</hi></p>                <lb/>
