<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* E zecht<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> Grimpes<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>.</hi> (S.  Grumpes.) (<hi rendition="#i">Siebenbürg.-sächs.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 37, 106.</hi></p>                <lb/>
