<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">198 Hand ön e Sied, Lûs öm Bossen, Schnodder undre Näs'.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, 1471.</hi></p>                <lb/>
