<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*868 'S hôt weder Hände noch Fisse.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Schles.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, III, 411, 442.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*869 'S is wî ma ane Hand imdrät.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, III, 413.</hi></p>                <lb/>
