<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Hannôwer is det hoge Fest, Hâmeln is det Rattennest, Eimbeck is det Râwennest, Norten is de Ântjepaus, Göttingen is de hôge Schaul.</hi> (S.  Hildesheim.) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Schambach, II, 691.</hi></p>                <lb/>
