<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*961 Bai dam Herrn doarf me sich ni sîr g'mäcke macha, a îs koarz g'rîta.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Peter, 448.</hi></p>                <lb/>
