<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">353 Wo ät Hätz van vol es, dô lööf d'r Monk (Mund) van övver.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Düren.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 483, 65.</hi></p>                <lb/>
