<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: Tristo quel pollaro, dove la gallina canta et il gallo tace. (<hi rendition="#i">Pazzaglia, 146, 7.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Hühnerkehle.</hi></head>                <lb/>
