<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">927 'N oll'n Hund blaff'n lêrn, hôlt swaor.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Altmark.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Danneil, 277.</hi></p>                <lb/>
