<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Ale neinj Jôr î (zwî) Wînjjôr.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Siebenbürg.-sächs.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Schuster, 59.</hi></p>                <lb/>
