<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Poln.</hi>: M&#x0142;odemu niebo kot&#x0142;em si&#x0119; widzi. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovsky, 305.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
