<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">687 Lêwer e klên Kind wie e Kalf.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, 2008.</hi></p>                <lb/>
