<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">699 Lütke Kinner trêt in den Schaut (Schos), graute Kinner in 't Hert (Herz).</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Lippe.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 269;</hi> für Strelitz: <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, III, 73, 92.</hi></p>                <lb/>
