<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*313 Et küemt sik, as dem Ossen de Mialke.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Iserlohn.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Woeste., 88, 150; Frommann, V, 61, 95.</hi></p>                <lb/>
