<p rendition="#et">Er geräth leicht in Zorn.</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*507 Böst em Kopp verdorw on öm Morsch verwahrlost.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*508 Dä hät der Kopp om räete Fleck.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Bedburg.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
