<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*521 Das wil mir nit in den Kopff.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Theatrum Diabolorum, 39<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>; Mathesius, Historia Jesu, CXVII<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
