<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*1 Hai krâned<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> sick as die Hucke an der Mistgaffel.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Grafschaft Mark.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 60, 92.</hi></p>                <lb/>
