<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">5 Kort un dick hett kin Geschick.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oldenburg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Goldschmidt, 159; Bueren, 767; Hauskalender, I.</hi></p>                <lb/>
