<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger"><cb n="1730"/>
6 Kort un dick is Bûrenschick (Bauernschick oder: -weise), schmoal un lank is stolten Gank, middenwank (mittenzwischen) is besten Gank.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Strelitz.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, III, 70, 1.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">7 Kort un krägel (munter, vergnügt) is bäter, as lang un'n Flägel.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oldenburg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 232, 36.</hi></p>                <lb/>
