<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">104 In allen Landen sint gude unde quade.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Tunn., 775.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Et bonus et pravus passim cernuntur et excors.</p>                <lb/>
